quo;s 4 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair came in at 33% of normal on the middle, and September to October came in at 34%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13381 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
